---
// Footer.astro - 网站底部
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-ink/10 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(26,26,26,0.98),rgba(15,15,15,1))] text-paper">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-6 py-14 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr,1fr] md:items-end">
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 md:p-8">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-paper/45">TechArt Chronicle</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">
          记录可复用的技术笔记与工作流方法
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-paper/70">
          聚焦 Unreal Engine、Houdini、Shader、PCG 和游戏开发中的实践经验。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 md:p-8 md:items-end">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-paper/55">
          <a href="/articles/" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">Articles</a>
          <a href="/series/" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">Series</a>
          <a href="/tools/" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">Tools</a>
          <a href="/videos/" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">Videos</a>
        </div>
        <a href="https://space.bilibili.com/18272055" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm font-semibold text-ochre transition-colors hover:text-paper">
          Bilibili →
        </a>
        <div class="text-xs text-paper/40">
          &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} TechArt Chronicle
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
